WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.000
1 00%

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.650
So fragile.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.120
In the end Inukami are just animals.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.050
Not fit to be my opponent.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.020
Well? Starting to feel the despair?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.430
You've got to be joking.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.060
I will never give up until Keita is here.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.030
Keita? Your master?

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.730
That's right. When he arrives, he won't lose to you.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.170
Yoko's Days, a diary about you that your father wrote.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.010
Give it back!

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.710
Yoko ran away from the mountain at night.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:53.850
My cute Yoko came back later, but for some reason she looked really happy.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.820
Give it back.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.360
All of a sudden,
Yoko said something outrageous.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.390
She wants to be an Inukami.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:05.130
Everybody laughed, but cute Yoko's resolve is firm.

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:07.400
Did she get a boyfriend?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.930
No. Give it back!

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.770
What a laughable story.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.400
A fox girl wanting to be an Inukami.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:20.780
Even if she falls in love, it will be unrequited.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.850
Truly a wasted effort.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.010
How incredibly foolish.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.820
Don't laugh.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:34.560
Yoko was a fox, but she was so determined to become an Inukami.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:39.260
She was laughed at and despised, but she kept thinking of Master Keita.

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:42.000
Nobody has the right to laugh at that.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:43.570
Sendan.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.070
It's hard to understand.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:47.800
You don't know.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.810
Master Keita is incredible.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.310
He's rash and reckless.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:55.480
But he can do unbelievable things.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:59.120
He will always come to help.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:02.590
A member of the Kawahira family that we Inukami serve.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:05.320
Don't underestimate him.

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.930
Help me.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.460
Yoko.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.970
Inukami!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.840
Light!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.410
Darn, is this it?

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.850
Yoko.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.940
You're... Ouch.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.110
Mr. Keita.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.840
Hang in there.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.750
Tomekichi. Raccoon.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:08.750
There's a weird mage rampaging in the city. It got really bad.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.250
You're the only one who can do something about it.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.690
What is it?

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.930
Even here?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.370
Tomekichi.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.740
I will go through.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.270
Don't be reckless. Let's run away.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:37.780
Mr. Keita, you always treated us as friends.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.380
Even if we're a cat, a kappa, and a raccoon.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.490
We were really happy about that.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.290
Tomekichi.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.760
That's why we want to repay you as friends.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.260
That's right, Mr. Keita.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.360
You guys.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.260
Leave this to us.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.000
Phew.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.010
Comrade Streak Lord, we shall assist.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.140
Peeping Doctor. Boss. Chief.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:10.110
This is our city.
We won't let you do as you please.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:14.820
If you're going to attack, attack me as you like.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:21.020
The fighting geek,
Naoki Kawarazaki is here.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:25.290
All right, comrades, scatter them and open a path.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.170
Everyone, why?

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.510
Such a silly question, Keita Kawahira.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:42.040
You are a light of hope for us who live in the dark.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.510
Everyone's counting on you.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.020
You would surely be able to do something.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:54.160
Keita! Keita!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.230
- Keita! Keita!
- Everyone.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.230
All right, leave it to me.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.160
I'll definitely beat up the enemy.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:06.270
Streak Lord!

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.600
Don't call me that.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:10.970
What's wrong?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.940
Forgive me, Kawahira. Was I too late?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.450
Diaper fetish now?

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:24.120
The great Streak Lord.
You are our pride.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:26.790
Who would wear this because they want to?

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.560
If I could turn back,
I would do so this instant.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.230
Kawahira, about that.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:35.230
I thought about how we can turn the situation around. The Daisakkai.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.670
Daisakkai?

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.870
If we use that, we can turn you back.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.900
We can also defeat the enemy.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.140
Is that so?

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:45.740
Kawarazaki, do you know where Daisakkai is?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:46.680
Leave it to me.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:51.450
Let's go everyone.
Our city's fate hangs on this battle.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.390
Keita Kawahira.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.560
He's your last hope, huh?

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.000
What's wrong?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.870
Then what if I destroy
Daisakkai right now?

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.010
Evil Fire!

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.180
Everyone, hurry to Daisakkai.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:23.050
Understood.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.220
Run, run.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.790
Look, the Daisakkai is just right over there.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.170
I won't let you.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.410
Fools.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.290
All your hopes will be gone with this.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:16.500
You shall know true despair.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.770
Kichijitsu Higashicho St.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.510
That is indeed the Daisakkai.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.380
Yoko!

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:34.850
Keita?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.850
Keita.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.720
Karina, please.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.260
Let's go, Kawahira.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.470
This is the end.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.300
Keita!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.370
Yoko.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.310
Master Keita.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.110
Yoko.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:37.780
No. This can't be true.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.350
Kawahira.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.620
It can't be.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.490
Wonderful.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:48.420
The world is filled with despair.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.890
Everybody has lost their hope, everybody's grieving.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:55.030
Gloomy, crying.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.730
This is the despair I wanted.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.110
Master Keita.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:15.620
Master Keita!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.090
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:24.530
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.810
Keita Kawahira, fully recovered.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.580
All right.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.180
I knew you would come.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.620
You really came.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.820
Kept you waiting, huh?

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.830
Why? Why are you alive?

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.430
Before your spell hit us,

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:02.200
I teleported us and Daisakkai underground.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.970
Being that close, your barrier won't work.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.740
And, as you can see,
I wished to turn myself back.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.210
But...

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:21.750
I'm glad.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:26.020
I'm glad I didn't ask Daisakkai to remove you from this world.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.060
I really am.

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:32.230
I will beat the heck out of you!

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.000
"Inukami!"

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.770
Woof woof.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.980
Blood of Sekidou, come.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.520
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.690
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:02.960
Evil Blaze.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.460
Worthless effort.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.430
Just fall into despair.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:11.730
Keita!

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.770
Evil Blaze!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.070
Frog, repel it.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.780
How's that? Feel despair?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.020
Not yet.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.790
Frog, pierce the enemy.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.630
Yoko's Days

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:44.970
Yoko.

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.010
Keita.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.410
Ouch.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.210
I'm sorry.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.750
It's okay. It's your treasure.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.380
Do you get it now?

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:05.690
You can't defeat me with that power of yours.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:06.920
Shut up!

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:09.260
I definitely won't give up.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.530
What?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.130
Keita.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.330
Believe in me.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.240
We're invincible when we're together, right?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.140
You really are interesting, Keita.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:34.080
You haven't changed since we met.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:38.990
Interesting, happy-go-lucky, very perverted, and stupid.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:43.330
But really strong and cool.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.160
And because you're like that...

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:55.440
Keita, I love you.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.440
Me too, Yoko.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:03.680
Keita.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.480
I'm going all out from now on.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:07.520
I'm counting on you.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:11.090
But, don't come to hate me.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.830
Yeah, I'm super good now.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.170
Let's go, Keita.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.910
All right. Let's finish this.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:37.080
In the name of the wise Hakusan.
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.150
Go.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.150
Payback for my friend.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.090
Secret move, Holy Crush.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.120
Karina.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.360
What's with these guys?

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:53.160
They were in despair just now.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.210
Master Keita.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.210
We did it.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.510
Imari. Sayoka.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:08.640
How dare you.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:11.450
That's enough. All of you, die.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:13.880
Purple Pillar.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.520
Igusa. Furano.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.790
Master Keita, do your best.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:22.520
If you beat him, I'll give you lots of services that can't be aired on TV.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.160
Really?

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.330
Keita.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.240
Keita!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.270
Are you all right?

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.410
Gokyoya. Tensou.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.180
Oh, so soft.

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:44.650
- Bigger than I thought.
- No.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.880
Geez, Keita.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.850
It's just a joke.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.790
Why? Why are you laughing?

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:56.320
Why are the others coming back too?

00:14:56.320 --> 00:15:00.530
They should've fallen into despair. But why?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.000
Is that his power?

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.370
You had better stay focused.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.470
Crimson.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.810
I won't forgive you.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:27.060
Tomohane. Sendan. Tayune.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.860
Master Keita, good luck.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.030
Right.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.900
Well, um... peace.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.270
Master Keita, here's a charm to make you energetic.

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:40.940
Thank you, I'm totally energetic now.

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.210
Everyone, let's go.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:47.880
Understood.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.120
Umm, I...

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.660
Everyone's finally here.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.230
Everyone.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.060
It can't be.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:13.540
I have mastered the arts of magic.
How can I lose to them?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.710
Let's hear what everyone has to say.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.540
What should we do with him?

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:22.310
Purgatory, Sendan.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.720
Then Purgatory it is.

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:31.750
You sinful one who laid your hands upon Master Kaoru.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:36.730
You shall learn why this fire carries the name of hell.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:39.930
Purification Flash,
Manifestation x All.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.630
Purgatory.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:49.800
How? How could I? Who are you all?

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:53.240
Let us tell you. We are Inukami.

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:58.250
We are ones that vanquish and fight evils ravaging this world.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.720
I'm Keita's Inukami, Yoko.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:06.990
Remember it, I'm an Inukami User.

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:09.590
- Keita, let's do it.
- Okay.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.960
We'll...

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.260
We will...

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.060
Beat him.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:20.540
Why? Why won't you fall into despair?

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.140
Why?

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.740
No way.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:32.550
In the name of the wise Hakusan. Frog.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.580
Explode!

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.330
We did it, Yoko.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.370
Keita.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.070
Keita!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.840
Master Keita.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.910
Je t'aime, Yoko.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.350
Kawahira.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.620
Streak Lord.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.170
I see.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.310
So that Jasei used up your magic and spiritual power.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.170
Now you're completely empty?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.180
Well, you reap what you sow.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:39.280
Darn. It's so pathetic.
I can't even break this rope.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:43.650
Please, at least let me take off this underwear.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.650
Shut up, pervert.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:49.260
From now on,
I will strictly reform you both.

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.160
You two will be proper men.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.160
Sobs.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.660
Heave-ho.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.440
This is Master Kaoru's real body.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.470
We found it in the enemy's secret base.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.370
Oh, what a stud.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.410
But this is empty.
Master Kaoru is already...

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.820
Wait, this is...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.190
Our contract ring with Master Kaoru?

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:20.460
That's right.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.990
The fact that this still remains means...

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:25.090
Master Kaoru is still alive.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.530
His alternate body is gone,

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.600
and his spirit is wandering around.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.430
Then let's find him.

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:37.840
That's right. We don't know where, but he's definitely somewhere.

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:40.510
Let's go find Master Kaoru.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.710
We'll look for our master.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.450
Of course. We'll look till the edge of the world.

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:54.560
Tomohane, you have a special mission.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:59.060
I want you to stay home with Master Kaoru's body.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.830
Huh? Why?

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.630
I want to go look for Master Kaoru too.

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:09.370
We want you to protect the place where Master Kaoru will go home to.

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.440
Place to go home?

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.280
There.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:24.020
Oh? So you were thinking about that back then?

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.850
Oh, I love you.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:29.290
No, it's just your dad's misunderstanding.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.730
Don't be so embarrassed.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:35.560
When I look at this,
I see how much you cared for me.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.000
Thanks, Keita.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:42.470
Let's make tons of memories from now on.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.470
More than the pages of this diary.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.570
Yeah.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.680
Hey Keita, what's a "rare animal"?

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.120
Today, a strange kid came to the mountain.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.490
He brought a net and chocolate cake.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:07.060
Apparently he was looking for a rare animal.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:11.100
I was really worried if my cute Yoko would get caught.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.570
Oh right, I had some business.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.740
This is you, right?

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.280
Answer honestly. I won't get mad.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.950
Well, I saw a TV show about a creature called a tsuchinoko.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.550
I just thought I might look for weird creatures and such.

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:33.860
But this is when I was a kid and didn't know anything.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:37.660
I was a very curious kid. Okay?

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.900
A kid that doesn't know anything...

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:46.830
Shouldn't try to sell rare animals to pet shops.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:53.240
Forgive me. I'll cut your nails and trim you later.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.910
I trusted you.
This betrayal is too much.

00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:00.720
Geez. I'll punish you for life so be prepared.

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.920
Wait!

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.550
Geez, those two never change.

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.720
And they'll keep doing that in the future too.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.560
Just like you and me.

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:16.730
Master Keita, do your best.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:18.800
They're as energetic as always.

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:20.740
It's Master Keita after all.

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:26.570
Keita, you idiot!

00:22:34.050 --> 00:22:36.420
You're truly our comrade, Streak Lord.

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:37.620
You're the best.

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:39.550
Streak Lord.

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.330
I've had enough of this lifestyle!
